{"name":"High Abbott Vorandel","size":"medium","type":"Humanoid","tag":"Elf","alignment":"lawful evil","hitDice":"17","armorName":"mage armor","shieldBonus":0,"natArmorBonus":2,"otherArmorDesc":"17 (div","speed":"30","burrowSpeed":"0","climbSpeed":"0","flySpeed":"0","hover":false,"swimSpeed":"0","customHP":false,"customSpeed":false,"hpText":"76 (17d8)","speedDesc":"30 ft.","strPoints":"10","dexPoints":"14","conPoints":"10","intPoints":"15","wisPoints":"20","chaPoints":"15","blindsight":"0","blind":false,"darkvision":"60","tremorsense":"0","truesight":"0","telepathy":0,"cr":"9","customCr":"8 (3,900 XP)","customProf":3,"isLegendary":false,"legendariesDescription":"The emerald order cult leader can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature's turn. The emerald order cult leader regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn.","isLair":false,"lairDescription":"When fighting inside its lair, the emerald order cult leader can invoke the ambient magic to take lair actions. On initiative count 20 (losing initiative ties), the emerald order cult leader can take one lair action to cause one of the following effects:","lairDescriptionEnd":"The emerald order cult leader can't repeat an effect until they have all been used, and it can't use the same effect two rounds in a row.","isMythic":false,"mythicDescription":"If the emerald order cult leader's mythic trait is active, it can use the options below as legendary actions for 1 hour after using {Some Ability}.","isRegional":false,"regionalDescription":"The region containing the emerald order cult leader's lair is warped by the creature's presence, which creates one or more of the following effects:","regionalDescriptionEnd":"If the emerald order cult leader dies, the first two effects fade over the course of 3d10 days.","properties":[],"abilities":[{"name":"Adhael's Blood Plague","desc":"[MON]'s form is unstable and only partially on this plane. [MON] has disadvantage on saving throws against conjuration spells and vulnerability to force damage.\n\nHowever, [MON] can also cast _Etherealness_ once per day, and has advantage on charisma checks when interacting with spiritual creatures."},{"name":"Elven Wiles","desc":"[MON] has advantage on saving throws against being charmed or frightened and cannot be put to sleep by magical means."},{"name":"Prophetic tactics","desc":"[MON] has leader has advantage on initiative rolls. In addition, at the start of each of the cult leader’s turns, one friendly creature within 30 feet of the cult leader has advantage on the first attack roll it makes before the start of the cult leader’s next turn."},{"name":"Spellcasting","desc":"[MON] is a 8th level spell caster, his spellcasting ability is Wisdom (spell save DC [WIS SAVE], [WIS ATK] to hit). He can cast the following spells:\n\n> cantrips (upcast): _toll the bell, mind sliver, spare the dying, thaumaturgy_\n>\n> at will: _command, frost fingers (15 ft cone, [2d8])_\n>\n> 2/day each: _mage armor, detect thoughts, lesser restoration, slow, dispel magic_\n>\n> 1/day each: _mislead, guards and wards_"}],"actions":[{"name":"Multiattack","desc":"[MON] makes one dagger attack and casts a cantrip."},{"name":"Dagger","desc":"_Melee or Ranged Weapon Attack:_ [STR ATK] to hit, reach 5 ft. or range 20/60 ft., one target. _Hit:_ [STR 1D4] piercing damage."}],"bonusActions":[{"name":"Inspire devotion","desc":"[MON] grants all allies within 30ft [3d8] temporary hit points"}],"reactions":[{"name":"Esoteric Vengeance","desc":"As a reaction when struck by a melee attack, [MON] can expend a spell slot to do [3d6] necrotic damage to the attacker."}],"legendaries":[],"mythics":[],"lairs":[],"regionals":[],"sthrows":[{"name":"int","order":3},{"name":"wis","order":4},{"name":"cha","order":5}],"skills":[{"name":"arcana","stat":"int"},{"name":"deception","stat":"cha"},{"name":"history","stat":"int"},{"name":"religion","stat":"int"}],"damagetypes":[{"name":"cold","note":" (Resistant)","type":"r"},{"name":"fire","note":" (Resistant)","type":"r"},{"name":"lightning","note":" (Resistant)","type":"r"}],"specialdamage":[],"conditions":[],"languages":[{"name":"Aire","speaks":true},{"name":"Common","speaks":true},{"name":"Elvish","speaks":true}],"understandsBut":"","shortName":"Vorandel","pluralName":"","doubleColumns":true,"separationPoint":3,"damage":[]}